+  "gate_is_not_forced": "The CONTROL arm, run back-to-back in the SAME tree with the SAME prompt and binary, FAILED 6/6. A pass region that could not have failed is unfalsifiable; this one demonstrably could, and did, at the shipped value.",
+  "gate_is_not_http_status_only": "Each cell also carries a stop taxonomy separating intended_budget_limit (generated == n_predict) from pool_exhaustion_limit (stop==limit but generated << n_predict). Had the gate been HTTP-status-only, the --parallel 1 candidate would have passed it and shipped a silent truncation.",
